 ShowMsgBigFont2;msg;parms;myFnt;myFnt2
 parms←##.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForShowMsg
 myFnt←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'APL385 Unicode')('Size' 30))
 parms.fontLabel←myFnt
 myFnt2←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Freestyle Script')('Size' 28))
 parms.fontStandard←myFnt2
 parms.posn←35 15
 parms.buttons←⊂'Carry on now'
 parms.statusbarMessage←'Uses APL385 for ther message but not elsewhere'
 msg←'This is a message' '' 'It serves as an example for what Dialogs.ShowMsg can do for you'
 parms ##.GUI.Dialogs.ShowMsg msg
⍝Done
